Project structure overview

- apps/: application code and domain logic (e.g., web UI, game-server, projectors)
- packages/: infrastructure-only shared libraries (e.g., db schema, http utils, rate limit)
- infra/: deployment/runtime infra (docker, cloudflared, postgres, scripts)

Domain boundary guidance

- Keep domain-specific logic and schemas inside the corresponding app under apps/.
- Do not place domain code (e.g., game/room aggregates, view schemas, event handling) in packages/.
- packages/ should remain generic/infra (database primitives, shared http/config helpers), with no domain coupling.

See `/README.md` for more details.